<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Sept 1-15 palm oil exports 310,058t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Sept 1-15 palm oil exports 310,058t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor, Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Monday said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for Sept 1-15 at 310,058 tonnes compared with 287,394 in Aug 1-15.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 60,730 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 153,081 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 43,310 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 52,937 tonnes.  </p>
<p>India, which was the main buyer during the period, taking 76,109 tonnes, China at 46,235 tonnes, Pakistan  at 29,380 tonnes and Egypt at 26,750.</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 17,614 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
